// Ch7 B07 "After the Bell" (docs/kb/story/beats/act1_ch07.md §2 B07). Played on the match's return,
// IDENTICAL WHATEVER THE RESULT: this script contains no read of the match's win flag and no line
// that names a score (tests/integration/test_ch07_thread.gd enforces it; "Win or lose" works both
// ways, which is the point). R06 at water level: the players surface in the catch-pool; Rhen and Tavi
// hang on the rim stones, breathing hard, and the crowd noise is warm either way. The pool-keeper (an
// old Tamsule woman who keeps the cup roll and the rim stones; not Order, no robe of office) chalks
// the withdrawal on her draw-slate. Rhen starts to untie the band; Tavi stops his hand. The lamp is
// the Low Reaches custom of a lamp on a mooring line for the ones who didn't come up (Ch6 B09). R07
// follows Oruvel's side out, wet, carrying their floats, through a crowd that parts for them, to
// their boat at the moorings; then holds on Rhen in the water. He doesn't go with them: he gets out
// on the other side, where Asha and Toma have come down, and Asha hands him his jacket. No line says
// he chose the pilgrimage. The chapter flow sets ch07_tavi_withdrew after it.
title: ch07_after_the_bell
location: ch07/tamsule_bell_galleries
---
@letterbox on
@camera R06
@music tidecup_after fade=1.5
@sfx crowd_warm
@wait 2.0
@anim rhen catch_breath
@anim tavi catch_breath
@mark poolkeeper poolkeeper_rim walk
@wait 1.0
Tavi [exhausted]: Oruvel withdraws. We've somewhere to be. #line:ch07_after_001
@anim poolkeeper chalk_slate
Poolkeeper [neutral]: Oruvel's name stays on the roll. #line:ch07_after_002
@anim tavi look_at rhen
Tavi [soft_smile]: Win or lose, she'd have yelled at us the same. #line:ch07_after_003
@anim rhen untie_band
@anim tavi stop_hand rhen
Tavi [tender]: Keep it till he wants it back. #line:ch07_after_004
Rhen [sad]: If you find anyone— #line:ch07_after_005
Tavi [neutral]: I'll hang a lamp. #line:ch07_after_006
@camera R07
@mark tavi tavi_leaves walk
@mark oruvel_diver_1 divers_boat walk
@mark oruvel_diver_2 divers_boat walk
@wait 3.0
@wait 1.5
@anim asha hand_jacket rhen
@wait 1.5
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
